@startuml remote_request_flow
!include _style.puml

title Core remote — request flow

participant "Local SCADA caller" as Client $external
participant "SessionProxy /\nservice proxy" as Proxy $tier
participant "ServerConnection" as Conn $tier
participant "SessionStub /\nnested stub" as Stub $tier
participant "SCADA service" as Service $tier

Client -> Proxy : Read / Write / Call / Browse / History / NodeMgmt
Proxy -> Conn : Protocol request
Conn -> Stub : Dispatch request
Stub -> Service : Service call or coroutine await
Service --> Stub : Result
Stub --> Conn : Protocol response
Conn --> Proxy : Response
Proxy --> Client : Callback / awaitable completion

@enduml
